#: scenario4:scenario4_888D00E4_5DDF_4A0F_AC21_3C76072CE6C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56ca068ce7a46b906084552286911bc9ac8b602c18e7dfb287dbfbafd327f791
#. default-sha256: 4fb43858d79bc1a8a79e32bc2bb9c1cd0036318ac61ed956a3d328dde489bb13
