msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫후후후……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3febbb1532da7ef130796dfcc17f3b5c8160504ba2da8c0b2cbd405a132ea6e
#. default-sha256: d727c1f9633121d587574feeff1e0547edcd40521f7af9d7fd04510cdca2b6e2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know now who you are, do you not?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You remember everything now, do you "
"not?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이제 ⟪k:3⟫당신이 누구인지 ⟪k:4⟫알지 않으셨는지요?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫모두…… 떠오르지 않으셨는"
"지요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71c77c9f7c599b4b36ab4d843f47e78d45d8ba673bc89903cdedf9eb3e254b97
#. default-sha256: 2e5aafe0cd8e1bae33b255ece44365545b5664e895e361dc02dc4fc5e5e3687e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were present in every single era.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The reason for which is as I described in the "
"previous tale:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은 ⟪k:1⟫모든 시대에 존재했습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그 이유는 ⟪k:4⟫제가 방금 ⟪k:5⟫보여 드린 그대"
"로……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84956f37fb3495ffd2ddd34014b00b3b6da1e4451e0c04b55d7e7ce8134addeb
#. default-sha256: e40e4bb8a4d92dc1cc06f71e9b2d148eab0376aab9ba02b0b0fea827421886a8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫because you yearned to be reunited with someone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But that person never showed up—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in any era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은 ⟪k:1⟫만나야 할 이가 있습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫하지만 그 사람은 어느 시대에도 ⟪k:4⟫없었지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd5c72ad3078c2be93a2c14c2b04b2c62107bfab497d6d77baf0e967a11ee90c
#. default-sha256: 07e41807d2e05680f2521271252c0eae7d34ca9062ad928bfadcbae688801cc4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And poor, sweet you, having no memory of any of that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫딱하게도 ⟪k:2⟫당신도 그 기억을 잃었기에……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫당신은 당신임에도 불구하고……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b4d2df2ba02c16238ab8343d718bafa01d3f08d0893b8cd8d80fe8e7936d142
#. default-sha256: e831bd8534c22f9bf1073c0c206a2b39dcb7c28a8f72e032efe03ca09ae9dad6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫lived those lives with other men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫다른 남성과 인생을 살아갔습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d6444d7ef70c7ff48260ff373d2068ae24c6409982fa784e542fc927acadeb7
#. default-sha256: 6781b8c774bd3e639ac01b493920f14b74a6a6857d1a31cc91b3320360bb01f8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is it any surprise misfortune befell those eras, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래서야 불행이 일어날 수밖에 없지요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd54180529642955af3e315b9bf12c24950714e63c16a3c91b2af1da1483e7d1
#. default-sha256: b15627a5f2361f5db6b7468c4d2f685fb54582899963aaf7ed6689b5371a195d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door swung closed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫문은 닫혔다. ⟪k:1⟫하지만――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2fd57905919be6b6a8078c4f2ee89f02e6c896ae7ea96c7b35d0aa21b304d13
#. default-sha256: b384f02eb5398dfcad1b5b91aa5e68eba33b6d114557ce1f6c84bbd968766d67
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But rather than outside, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid were inside the dull, "
"monochrome room at the top of the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「당신」과⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」와⟪k:4⟫ 시녀는 ⟪k:5⟫아직 문 안쪽에 있었다.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫감시"
"탑 광경이 ⟪k:8⟫색채가 빠진 상태로 눈에 들어왔다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b89ecf90d7d3efa54a4f37774f705cf95b1801136e6cd6956ebedb809a9f2394
#. default-sha256: c8f8d7d2e4eb7a18783bde5abb527ea3c76138bd6c991ea173e82028e9e00f42
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The awe-inspiring ray of light shone not through the lone window high upon the stone wall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫천장에서 내리쬐던 거룩한 빛은 ⟪k:1⟫이곳에 없었다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96c08cfecba47788695501e17b58a4142e7bf5590f21dc5d909fba98c16fe62a
#. default-sha256: 479ca561e49890039797059eadc98fe252713766bf42baf4bef2441164709c69
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wrapped in a curious, impenetrable darkness, ⟪k:1⟫You both⟪k:2⟫they⟪k:3⟫ stood alone in the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫기이한 어둠에 지배된 공간――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫여기에 있는 건 ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「당신」과⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫「죽은 자」"
"와⟪k:7⟫ 시녀 뿐."

#: scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d236a66b43128aae48e7a38a954d9bb987e6d474e353b6c0703c51d10cc954e6
#. default-sha256: e0d04df45d37c93a84601feefd66032aa0fdb984608cacea57f0c4c1d3251056
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Maid wore a gentle, but brittlely cold smile as she looked straight at ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫"
"him⟪k:3⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫시녀는 따스하면서도 ⟪k:1⟫싸늘한 ⟪k:2⟫위태로운 미소를 지은 채, ⟪k:3⟫「당신」을⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫「죽"
"은 자」를⟪k:6⟫ 보고 있었다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f668d25ec74e7064a61cdad240bca60f56b893021290e0aa8b14a1762ad77bf9
#. default-sha256: 23c9fc5624596a17c3c360f896913c9a559d45c1991225597f127b9671cf6280
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not your fault misfortune befell you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The only force to blame for that "
"is fate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫불행이 일어난 건 ⟪k:2⟫당신 탓이 아니랍니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫모든 것은 운이 좋지 않았을 뿐……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72ae9776fc10eeeca6a5a18973a53cb172752d0ad7d03f8d5f29efb7613910e2
#. default-sha256: a5e9ee12713c4df91f38d51b568ba772c0a2bad3b40636bf92eb9268614ef603
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were always so kind, so pure of heart.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You had boundless trust for others and "
"the goodness of people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당신은 늘 선량하며 ⟪k:1⟫순수했습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫남을 의심하지 않고, ⟪k:4⟫남의 선의를 믿는 모습"
"은……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6b7c56bc2391ef0ddadf94ec3d6836bc8cec6ca40921c829b2bce7e8b75dc42
#. default-sha256: 8016efee381604e32b603dc4594916ca86747e2b1b587f5490eecfa42d520fa8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were the very image of all that is right."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫선의 결정체와도 같았지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51be3cf44b581f8db6cf95f312a6b48a72381f6a17725fa41102f7ed678f1285
#. default-sha256: 15db0e11cfd971a0868d16f5ccac8deb7ae0f5fa8c75365df092a10601771284
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is no greater misfortune⟪k:2⟫than someone as pure and beautiful as you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫진정한 불행이란…… 바로 이 점일 겁니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫당신처럼 한결같고 아름다운 사람이――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd55243f5bed1642541e7cb0a977fcde43d46ed81540a9ad01141cc0df6e9586
#. default-sha256: ff2776cd51f8ec2a5729eace79b3f13d6a2247b38923a0c5aea826e965e51467
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫being mercilessly thrown into the grinding gears of tragedy again and again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어쩔 도리도 없이 비극 속 톱니바퀴의 일부가 되는 것."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34eb34f9433f7439ae02a5b48681f11373ebcb37db98c4281c8e2612a9c3cc8f
#. default-sha256: ecb480df95157d402266c1979dd91f066ac8562d7f0c5d5c1421b71fa40ab544
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still pity you for everything you had to go through.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You poor, poor soul..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저는 ⟪k:2⟫지금도 ⟪k:3⟫딱하게 느낀답니다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫아아, ⟪k:6⟫참으로 딱하신 분……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 101aa594424a3dcee44bc4d2b91ab7ad3b2fe0e359a79000bceb41413c8241a7
#. default-sha256: be829c3b75aa9e820f124d3e9b61d11dacdc4f6d9e99d4ff1609b173b2c3df72
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be utterly exhausted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantly betrayed, the man you were waiting "
"for never appearing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫많이 지치셨지요?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫믿던 이에게 배신당하고, ⟪k:4⟫기다리던 이가 오지 않아……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6b5a0769961e393ce15ce8b4c6224715a40fe19ce504e5e1c4aebd47a6d6640
#. default-sha256: 727bd646ffdb53b99aef3fb391591d9aba9db3437f83bee999bd4d15d72f1804
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After so long, your spirit worn down to the bone, you lost any and all awareness of who you "
"even were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫끝내 당신 자신의 마음마저 피폐해져,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫본인이 누군지도 알 수 없어질 지경까지……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec6cfda535f9f9aa2ba5d66deb5586de6f339784091f71092a4cfae39319247a
#. default-sha256: 20b0602a7296415fa28f3d1c4dece61c2667b8126ef5ed9f5e5a22941893d2db
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who were you hoping to find wandering into this illusory mansion, cut off from the real "
"world?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫당신은 현세에 나타나지 않은 이러한 신기루에 들어오면서까지 ⟪k:2⟫대체 누구를 찾으시는지"
"요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_716DBB68_10D9_481D_8BE8_44D7085A4A92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa48f67594dc0775f294bd46f2e7f1510d171aed88f9910de0d80708e995f87c
