msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You and I are the only ones here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The man you seek is nowhere to be found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 저택에는 ⟪k:2⟫저와 당신만 있습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫당신이 찾으시던 이는 ⟪k:5⟫어디에도 없습"
"니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D9D9251E_BDA5_4F17_BB6F_B4981CBF1062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d22ec096db32cb9b8343e24ef2ddba7e161e5a6ffe68978c63c220b8c6292a63
#. default-sha256: 6df920ffc10da78ca590e3ccc2b634df3b158ac3d5e7e53d8b25068fda675773
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D9D9251E_BDA5_4F17_BB6F_B4981CBF1062"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Have you still not figured it out?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then allow me to tell you everything:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……아직 ⟪k:2⟫이해가 덜 되셨는지요?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그렇다면 ⟪k:5⟫모든 진실을 알려 드리지요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2FDF6054_67BE_483A_8E0F_1ACFC97E34D9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05fd8081918f86e0739580e10e86c39287539ee72eef51eb88caaa9d03fe8b0b
