msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I am the cursed witch, Morgana, who haunts this mansion,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫바로 제가 ⟪k:2⟫이 저택에 사는 저주받은 마녀, ⟪k:3⟫모르가나."

#: scenario4:scenario4_48576C9C_408D_4479_B9E3_D4FD79EAA46A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8631bcbf7b31fa1abb5fb1392898b17b6f852939524f5ba43cfed7443e881c4
