msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C5E7A395_2B07_4B4A_9C2B_E0E8372CDB24"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did my calling you “Master” confuse you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 당신을 ⟪k:1⟫“주인님”이라 불러서…… 이해가 잘 안 되신 걸지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9D622A0C_3598_4B4F_95F8_D35E1690C484
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f35a419ddae4ef4678da6c40f9c3f2e3318516e9421ddef37d950ccbf243735
