msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If so, then I apologize.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫My habit of calling the master—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫or mistress—"
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫of the house “Master” is quite deeply ingrained."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫만약 그게 맞다면 ⟪k:2⟫죄송합니다. ⟪k:3⟫저는 ⟪k:4⟫주인을 그렇게 부르도록 ⟪k:5⟫습관을 들였"
"거든요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0B9898C5_8FC5_48E0_BD9F_D0F7EBD14DC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c6bc4316315cb8e3769f9b1bfe646ef804e4346aa4f66a538f1666123362d94
