msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0B9898C5_8FC5_48E0_BD9F_D0F7EBD14DC4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And yes... ⟪k:2⟫that means precisely what you think it does:⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that I have "
"accepted you as my new master.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That I wish for you to remain here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫예……, 바로 당신이 ⟪k:2⟫이 저택에 남으시기에 걸맞습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫제 주인이 되시기에 걸맞"
"지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_64A0889C_8CE4_4672_BB47_145C028D4202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2748faf597dbc38dab5ddb5bd47ce5607ee4d5834f8ddd99b94f8cb3ccffdd78
