msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_590C7DF6_DB76_420D_9175_E9571739B519"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do not worry. There is nothing to fear.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We are simply going to step outside "
"the river of time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫괜찮답니다……. 불안해하실 필요는 ⟪k:2⟫어디에도 없습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫모든 시간의 흐름에서 벗"
"어납시다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_75D0E684_F5AF_4F47_82D5_DB232C826D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e65291ddbefdbaf82e087346f8c12d5e9fad3aca1af36cc813b81e6ad4af6d88
