msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nothing unpleasant will ever happen to you again.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I will be here with you for all "
"eternity,⟪k:3⟫and I will give you my utmost care."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫무서운 일은 ⟪k:1⟫영영 안 일어날 겁니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저는 ⟪k:4⟫당신을 영원히 ⟪k:5⟫따스하게 대할 "
"겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5BC3DE32_7523_4C44_96C9_529ADD782D4B
