msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5BC3DE32_7523_4C44_96C9_529ADD782D4B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You will not have to wait for anyone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Forget about him—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫the man you once "
"sought—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫더 이상 ⟪k:1⟫누구도 기다리지 말고……,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫당신이 바라던 그 선한 사람도 ⟪k:4⟫잊고 지냅시"
"다."

