msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저를 위해……, ⟪k:1⟫부디 ⟪k:2⟫끄덕여 주시어요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C0F22893_4EE6_45CF_948E_1CA0F4EEA898
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4afb72053d448c23e0c86b38b05ce2e0e432c56e37f84141f7b31fc2449f1bcf
