"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have been waiting for you for so, so very long.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I have wanted nothing more "
"than to see you again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저는 ⟪k:2⟫당신을 오래도록 기다렸거든요. ⟪k:3⟫당신을 간절히 만나고 싶었거든요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3DEE3046_B752_44FC_B266_6CB8F8569649
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4971b05633d04947a0e977b447166c77b818af83e9ca89fa17067d28233657b
