#: scenario4:scenario4_9DFE67AB_5ECC_4308_89CB_B63FBA7695C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b0534ac4e58c411e9408d339def8764122633313783d13bb7f432587d54cf50
