msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1DF94103_D2F4_420A_B86F_8DE789045661"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫if you knew of all the pain it has caused you to suffer thus far."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫다시 해 보잔 생각은 안 들지 않겠는지요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A764BDA2_57DF_4B08_A4F8_95F1F0666B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80d3ee48d14ebdedceff135f7791937e7bda1547c83ca17df9b768f558cdef1e
#. default-sha256: 830b73ad159a05a3e7c34c510d566b99401ba94198a85ff3aa7e95cb49bf0b74
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A764BDA2_57DF_4B08_A4F8_95F1F0666B16"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Spend eternity with me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫in the gentle embrace of darkness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 따스한 어둠에 안기어……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저와 영원한 시간을 보내어요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_38D2F3A2_A364_406E_8805_9656D731874A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01a9b3605881a393e2af7bf6b7b0ab99be6340f711809a7e16d89fbf72e81cea
