msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her fingers, brushing up against ⟪k:1⟫Yours⟪k:2⟫his⟪k:3⟫, were as cold as ever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫역시 ⟪k:1⟫「당신」⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:4⟫의 손에 닿은 그 손끝은 ⟪k:5⟫변함없이 ⟪k:6⟫얼음처"
